==Battleground==
*10 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Othom]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Stall at the start to build up cash, then use generic anti-Relics to keep away Othom and use random anti-Floating units for White Cyclone. [[Ultra Delinquent Cat]] in particular comes out of retirement for this stage if you're really struggling thanks to his built-in Curse Immunity, but this stage is pretty easy anyways.

==Trivia==
*The Theory of Felinity is the first non-event stage to contain a full-sized [[:Category:Cyclones|Cyclone]].
*The stage name is a reference to the scientific [[wikipedia:Theory of relativity|theory of relativity]].

